sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Content
    participant B as Background
    participant S as Supabase
    U->>C: click Highlight
    C->>B: create-note
    B->>S: await upsert page (~200ms)
    S-->>B: ok
    B->>S: await insert note (~200ms)
    S-->>B: ok
    B-->>C: broadcast
    Note over U: 用户看到高亮 · ~400 ms
